tinybatchls independently implements bounded weighted Levenberg-Marquardt fitting.
Frozen regression outputs were generated with SciPy 1.18.1 least_squares (LM)
and NumPy 2.5.4 covariance from analytical model Jacobians, both BSD licensed.
No reference software source is translated or included. Raw reference outputs
and generator stay ignored in .validation/tinybatchls/.
https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.optimize.least_squares.html
